<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-PAKISTAN BEAT ZIMBABWE BY THREE WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN BEAT ZIMBABWE BY THREE WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>QUETTA, Pakistan 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan beat Zimbabwe</p>
<p>by three wickets in the first of three one-day internationals</p>
<p>on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scores: Zimbabwe 237-9 (50 overs); Pakistan 238-7 (49.1</p>
<p>overs).</p>
</text>
